    LLM: "Mark penalty tiles; use double-0 (lead as blank to win, as double to dump). Moon shots more frequent than in Hearts.\n\nLead low blanks to force 0-0 out; when passing, passing high tiles left helps neighbour's moon-shot.\n\nHolding doubles and penalty tiles can defend against moon-shots. Same family as 11 and 21 Point Black Tile.",
